WEBVTT

01:03:00.746 --> 01:03:04.496
But we do get something really
important in return.

01:03:04.829 --> 01:03:06.454
And I think that as a force

01:03:06.454 --> 01:03:12.996
for making things that make all of our
lives better happen, it's very cool.

01:03:13.038 --> 01:03:15.329
Otherwise, you know, like if you have,
like, a great idea,

01:03:15.621 --> 01:03:18.871
but you don't actually do anything useful
with it for people, that's still cool.

01:03:18.871 --> 01:03:20.038
It's still intellectually interesting.

01:03:20.413 --> 01:03:23.371
But like, there's got to
be something about

01:03:23.371 --> 01:03:25.329
the reward function in
society that is like,

01:03:25.329 --> 01:03:28.454
did you actually do something useful?
Did you create value?

01:03:28.871 --> 01:03:31.246
And I think entrepreneurship
and startups are